# Declared in `../beans.json` as the `workflow-state` node, and empty until a
# BPMN instance is started.
#
# Same reason as `todos/feedback/.gitkeep`: git does not track an empty
# directory, and a declared-but-absent directory is the bean `dh4f` defect.
#
# This one was PRE-EXISTING and uncaught — `beans/beans.json` has declared
# `workflows` since the graph was written, and the directory has never been on
# disk. Found 2026-09-19 while fixing the same defect in the todo graph, and
# fixed here rather than noted: a gate exposing a pre-existing defect is a
# predictable cost of adding one, and the answer is to fix the defect.
